{"Smart feeding.\nMaximum yield.\nMinimal cost.": "Pemberian pakan cerdas.\nHasil maksimal.\nBiaya minimal.", "Continue": "Lanjutkan", "Email Address": "Alamat Email", "Enter PIN": "Masukkan PIN", "Proceed": "Lanjutkan", "OR": "ATAU", "New User? ": "Pengguna baru? ", "Register here": "Daftar di sini", "Forgot PIN? ": "Lupa PIN? ", "Tap here": "Ketuk di sini", "Reset Your PIN": "Atur Ulang PIN Anda", "Enter your registered email to receive a reset link": "Masukkan email terdaftar Anda untuk menerima tautan pengaturan ulang", "Create Account": "Buat Akun", "Back": "Kembali", "Name": "Nama", "Country": "Negara", "Loading countries...": "Memuat negara...", "Select": "Pilih", "Confirm PIN": "Konfirmasi PIN", "PINs do not match": "PIN tidak cocok", "Reset PIN": "Atur Ulang PIN", "Sending...": "Mengirim...", "Check Your Email": "Periksa Email Anda", "We've sent PIN reset instructions to your email address. Please check your inbox.": "Kami telah mengirim petunjuk pengaturan ulang PIN ke alamat email Anda. Silakan periksa kotak masuk Anda.", "Back to Login": "Kembali ke Login", "Upgrade Your PIN": "Tingkatkan PIN Anda", "Time to upgrade your PIN": "Saatnya meningkatkan PIN Anda", "RationSmart now uses a 6-digit PIN for stronger security. Confirm your existing\n              4-digit PIN and pick a new 6-digit one.": "RationSmart kini menggunakan PIN 6 digit untuk keamanan yang lebih kuat. Konfirmasikan PIN 4 digit Anda yang ada dan pilih PIN 6 digit yang baru.", "Current 4-digit PIN": "PIN 4 digit saat ini", "New 6-digit PIN": "PIN 6 digit baru", "Confirm New PIN": "Konfirmasi PIN Baru", "New PINs do not match": "PIN baru tidak cocok", "Update PIN": "Perbarui PIN", "PIN Updated": "PIN Diperbarui", "Your account now uses a 6-digit PIN. Please sign in with your new PIN.": "Akun Anda sekarang menggunakan PIN 6 digit. Silakan masuk dengan PIN baru Anda.", "Sign In": "Masuk", "Verify Email": "Verifikasi Email", "We've sent a verification link to your email address. Tap the link to activate your\n          account, then sign in.": "Kami telah mengirim tautan verifikasi ke alamat email Anda. Ketuk tautan untuk mengaktifkan akun Anda, lalu masuk.", "Resend Verification Email": "Kirim Ulang Email Verifikasi", "Resending...": "Mengirim ulang...", "Continue to Login": "Lanjutkan ke Login", "Terms & Conditions": "Syarat & Ketentuan", "Last updated: January 2025 · Digital Green Foundation": "Terakhir diperbarui: Januari 2025 · Digital Green Foundation", "1. Acceptance of Terms": "1. Penerimaan Syarat", "By accessing and using RationSmart, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the application.": "Dengan mengakses dan menggunakan RationSmart, Anda menerima dan setuju untuk terikat oleh Syarat dan Ketentuan ini. Jika Anda tidak setuju, jangan gunakan aplikasi ini.", "2. Use of Service": "2. Penggunaan Layanan", "RationSmart is designed to assist livestock farmers and agricultural professionals in optimizing cattle feed formulation. The recommendations provided are based on scientific models and should be used as advisory information only.": "RationSmart dirancang untuk membantu peternak dan profesional pertanian dalam mengoptimalkan formulasi pakan ternak. Rekomendasi yang diberikan didasarkan pada model ilmiah dan harus digunakan sebagai informasi saran saja.", "3. Data Privacy": "3. Privasi Data", "We collect and process data necessary to provide the feed formulation service. Your data is handled in accordance with applicable data protection laws. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.": "Kami mengumpulkan dan memproses data yang diperlukan untuk menyediakan layanan formulasi pakan. Data Anda ditangani sesuai dengan undang-undang perlindungan data yang berlaku. Kami tidak menjual data pribadi Anda kepada pihak ketiga.", "4. Accuracy of Information": "4. Akurasi Informasi", "While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date recommendations, Digital Green does not warrant that the information is complete, reliable, or suitable for any particular purpose. Consult a qualified veterinarian or nutritionist for critical decisions.": "Meskipun kami berusaha memberikan rekomendasi yang akurat dan terkini, Digital Green tidak menjamin bahwa informasi tersebut lengkap, dapat diandalkan, atau sesuai untuk tujuan tertentu. Konsultasikan dengan dokter hewan atau ahli gizi yang berkualifikasi untuk keputusan penting.", "5. Account Responsibility": "5. Tanggung Jawab Akun", "You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You agree to notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account.": "Anda bertanggung jawab untuk menjaga kerahasiaan kredensial akun Anda. Anda setuju untuk segera memberi tahu kami tentang penggunaan akun Anda yang tidak sah.", "6. Intellectual Property": "6. Kekayaan Intelektual", "All content, logos, and software within RationSmart are the property of Digital Green Foundation. You may not reproduce or distribute any part of the service without written permission.": "Semua konten, logo, dan perangkat lunak dalam RationSmart adalah milik Digital Green Foundation. Anda tidak boleh mereproduksi atau mendistribusikan bagian mana pun dari layanan tanpa izin tertulis.", "7. Limitation of Liability": "7. Batasan Tanggung Jawab", "Digital Green Foundation shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from use of RationSmart or reliance on its recommendations.": "Digital Green Foundation tidak bertanggung jawab atas kerugian tidak langsung, insidental, khusus, atau konsekuensial yang timbul dari penggunaan RationSmart atau ketergantungan pada rekomendasinya.", "8. Changes to Terms": "8. Perubahan Syarat", "We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the application after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.": "Kami berhak mengubah syarat-syarat ini kapan saja. Penggunaan aplikasi yang berlanjut setelah perubahan merupakan penerimaan atas syarat yang diperbarui.", "9. Contact": "9. Kontak", "For questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at admin@digitalgreen.org.": "Untuk pertanyaan tentang Syarat dan Ketentuan ini, silakan hubungi kami di admin@digitalgreen.org.", "User Manual": "Manual Pengguna", "FAQs": "FAQ", "Contact Us": "Hubungi Kami", "Cattle Info": "Info Sapi", "Simulation Details": "Detail Simulasi", "Simulation Name *": "Nama Simulasi *", "Country *": "Negara *", "Select country": "Pilih negara", "Animal Category *": "Kategori Hewan *", "Select category": "Pilih kategori", "Animal Characteristics": "Karakteristik Hewan", "Breed Selection *": "Pemilihan Ras *", "Select breed": "Pilih ras", "Holstein": "Holstein", "Crossbreed": "Persilangan", "Indigenous": "Lokal", "Body Weight (BW; kg) *": "Berat Badan (BW; kg) *", "Value Range 350-720": "Rentang Nilai 350-720", "BW Gain (kg/day) *": "Pertambahan BW (kg/hari) *", "Value Range 0-1.8": "Rentang Nilai 0-1.8", "Body Condition Score *": "Skor Kondisi Tubuh *", "Value Range 1-5": "Rentang Nilai 1-5", "Days in Milk *": "Hari dalam Laktasi *", "Value Range 0-400": "Rentang Nilai 0-400", "Reproductive Data": "Data Reproduksi", "Days of Pregnancy *": "Hari Kehamilan *", "Value Range 0-280": "Rentang Nilai 0-280", "Parity *": "Paritas *", "Milk Production": "Produksi Susu", "Milk Production (L) *": "Produksi Susu (L) *", "Value Range 1-59": "Rentang Nilai 1-59", "Milk Protein % *": "Protein Susu % *", "Milk Fat % *": "Lemak Susu % *", "Milk Price (${user.currency}/L)": "Harga Susu (${user.currency}/L)", "Optional": "Opsional", "Environment": "Lingkungan", "Avg Temperature (°C) *": "Suhu Rata-rata (°C) *", "Active Grazing": "Penggembalaan Aktif", "What does Active Grazing do?": "Apa fungsi Penggembalaan Aktif?", "Grazing activity increases energy requirements. If enabled, RationSmart adds an extra energy allowance based on topography and distance walked. Leave this off for housed animals.": "Akti